WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.467
One successful fit may depend on the start. Compare nine starting guesses.

00:00:05.467 --> 00:00:10.933
All paths use the same data, model, and public parameter bounds.

00:00:10.933 --> 00:00:16.400
Reaching the same solution supports convergence for this problem, not held-out validation.
